  "type": "manhwa",
  "description": "Returning student U Hui-Ram is bursting with excitement as he begins him first stint in the dorms, dreaming of having a great time with his roommate! However, when his roommate vanishes, leaving behind only a doll of Hui-Ram’s favorite manga character, Hui-Ram finds himelf unexpectedly starting a “fun” roommate life (?) with the doll. Then one day, while half-asleep, he ends up hugging and even groping something he mistook for the doll…\n\nBut starting the very next day, a suspicious upperclassman from his class begins to avoid him with an oddly cold demeanor…? Will Hui-Ram be able to uncover the truth hidden within his “dream”?\n\n(Source: Lezhin, translated)",
